    "text": "Won’t hold up his end of the deal? What exactly is 'genius' about this?\nThe U.S. gets up to 50% of Ukraine’s mineral resources—part of a deal that includes deploying U.S. military forces on the ground to guard those resources.\nNow what? Is Zelensky going to back out and ask the U.S. military to leave? That would be like telling Putin, 'Go ahead, kill the rest of us and take the country.'\nSee how this works?\nGenius.",
